<title>USA: Equisure Inc votes two-for-one split.</title>
<headline>Equisure Inc votes two-for-one split.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Equisure Inc said Friday that its board had voted a two-for-one stock split, effective November 29, record November 22.</p>
</text>
